/-
Wt1Check.D11Plan — box-independent production checker kit for the D11 cone.

Lane `wt1-emission-prod-w1` (2026-11-25), generated by
`scripts/gen_kit_prod.py` (do not edit by hand).

* `leafPlan` is the topological stack program of the D11 tree (40 bits per
  instruction, instruction 0 in the low chunk) over the 46 plan inputs;
* `leafRenders` is the plan-input render list (`matan (w1tX y4 y5 y6)`
  atoms stay opaque, `K1/K2` stay atomic: the landed `LeafShapes` form);
* `runPR_eq` is the single `rfl` fact that the plan's real denotation is
  `leafOutR` (the ten output renders);
* `d11_bridge` rewrites `w1F2` to `d11Render` through the landed `sh_*`;
* `sh_<slot>_full` are the same rewrites for the nine non-matan outputs.

No `axiom` / `sorry` / `admit` / `native_decide`.
-/
import Kepler.Text.TaylorSecond.LeafGenKit
